"""
BUCKSHOT - Shotgun roulette / Ruleta de escopeta.
Single player vs bots or LAN multiplayer. Spanish / English.

  python buckshot.py            -> opens the game window
  python buckshot.py server     -> dedicated server (no window)

Build a standalone app for itch.io (Windows/Linux/macOS):
  pip install pyinstaller
  pyinstaller --onefile --noconsole --name Buckshot buckshot.py
Then zip the file from the "dist" folder and upload it to itch.io.

Network: TCP 5555 (game) + UDP 5556 (LAN discovery). Standard library only.
"""
